Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.94,0:22:16.40,OP/ED JP,,20,0,0,,{\an7\fs56\bord3.2\c&HFAFAFA&\3c&H688923&\fad(200,200)}ホント厄介な生き物だ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.40,0:22:19.28,OP/ED JP,,20,0,0,,{\an7\fs56\bord3.2\c&HFAFAFA&\3c&H688923&\fad(200,200)}ああ言えばこう　こう言えばああ
